message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "Operational-legitimacy decision shield: reproducibility package"
abstract: >-
  Computational artefacts reproducing the results of the manuscript "Physically Safe,
  Procedurally Unauthorised: Formalising Operational Legitimacy Constraints for
  Trustworthy AI Decision Support in Industrial Control Systems". The framework composes
  an operational-legitimacy layer (Answer Set Programming) with a physical-admissibility
  layer (Signal Temporal Logic) in a decision shield.
